      "solution": "Calculation:\n\nLet the average age of 25 members be = x\n\nSum of ages of new members = Y \n\nSum of 25 members Age = 25x\n\nAge of replaced two member = 64 + 40 = 104\n\nAccording to the question\n\n⇒ 25x - 104 + Y = (x - 2) 25\n\n⇒ 25x - 104 + Y + 25x - 50\n\n⇒ Y = 54\n\n**So, the Average of new members = 54/2**\n\n** = 27**",
