      "correct": "2",
      "solution": "Calculation:\n\nLet SP of 1 cap = 1\n\nSo, SP of 30 caps = 30\n\nWe know that,\n\nSP - CP = Profit\n\n⇒ 30 -CP = 3\n\n⇒ CP = 27\n\nProfit % = (SP - CP)/CP × 100\n\n= (30 - 27)/27 × 100\n\n= 3/27 × 100\n\n**= 11.11%**",
