      "question": "Both X and Y together can complete a work in 12 days and Y alone can complete the same work in 30 days. In how many days will X alone complete the work?",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "1",
          "text": "15"
        },
        {
          "label": "2",
          "text": "20"
        },
        {
          "label": "3",
          "text": "18"
        },
        {
          "label": "4",
          "text": "16"
        }
      ],
      "correct": "2",
      "solution": "Calculation:\n\nX and Y together can complete a work = 12 days\n\nY alone can complete the same work = 30\n\nLet X alone can complete the same work = x days\n\n⇒ 1/x + 1/30 = 1/12\n\n⇒ 1/x = 1/12 - 1/30\n\n⇒ 1/x = (30 - 12)/(30 × 12)\n\n**∴ x = 20 days**",
      "tags": [
        "Time and Work"
      ]
